# Extra directories to expose inside the game session's sandbox.
# Copy to /etc/game-mode/binds and edit. One entry per line:
#
#   rw <path>   read-write (game saves, mod managers, launcher state)
#   ro <path>   read-only  (scripts used in Steam launch options)
#
# Paths are relative to the session user's home unless they start with /.
# Paths that don't exist are skipped. Steam, Discord and the common engine
# dirs (Godot, Unity, Valve) are already exposed by game-mode-wrapper.
#
# Examples:
# rw .local/share/PrismLauncher
# rw .config/r2modman
# ro .local/bin
